<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT FREE STATE 35-20 IN CURRIE CUP.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT FREE STATE 35-20 IN CURRIE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defending champions Natal beat</p>
<p>Free State 35-20 (halftime 18-3) to reach the final of the</p>
<p>Currie Cup competition on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Tries: James Small, Federico Mendez, Wickus van</p>
<p>Heerden, Andre Joubert, Kevin Putt. Conversions: Andre Joubert</p>
<p>(2). Penalties: Thierry Lacroix, Joubert.</p>
<p>Free State - Tries: Helgard Muller, Werner Swanepoel.</p>
<p>Conversions: MJ Smith (2). Penalty: Smith. Drop goal: Smith.</p>
</text>
